 # IDEA_SOURCE — fc_nnue_h256_e12_ep12_ep10base  (REAL H256 net on the locked ep10 source base; UNPROVEN)
 
+## S04 optional thread-safe first attack-table initialization (20261025)
+
+Idea sources: the user's S4 request, the existing Forge cold-first-Board race
+reproducer and the standard C++ std::call_once publication guarantee documented
+at https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/thread/call_once . The implementation is
+original. One optional once flag encloses all existing table writes, so every
+successful caller waits for complete initialization. The old early bool is kept
+only in the OFF branch. No attack values, algorithms or engine data are copied
+from another project. The cold regression uses eight simultaneous first Board
+constructors in each fresh process; it never serially bootstraps a Board.
+
